SepaMandateForStancerPageTitle = Creating your SEPA mandate
SEPALegalTextStancer = By signing this mandate form, you authorize (A) %s to send instructions to your bank to debit your account, and (B) your bank to debit your account in accordance with %s instructions. You have the right to be reimbursed by your bank under the conditions described in your agreement with it. A refund request must be submitted within 8 weeks of the date your account was debited for an authorized debit. You agree to receive notification of upcoming debits within 2 days prior to their occurrence. Any rejected debit will also be charged according to our general terms and conditions.
SEPALegalTextStancer2 = By completing this mandate form, you authorize (A) %s to send instructions to your bank to debit your account, and (B) your bank to debit your account in accordance with %s instructions. You have the right to be reimbursed by your bank under the conditions described in your agreement with it. A refund request must be submitted within 8 weeks of the date your account was debited for an authorized debit. You agree to receive notification of upcoming debits within 2 days prior to their occurrence. Any rejected debit will also be charged according to our general terms and conditions.
SEPALegalTextStancerDPO = The information contained in this mandate is intended to be used by the creditor only for the management of its relationship with its customer. They may give rise to the exercise by the latter of their rights of opposition, access, erasure, portability, limitation and rectification as provided for in articles 38 et seq. of law no. 78-17 of January 6, 1978 relating to data processing, files and freedoms, by emailing %s.
